  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toleetanga kiweebwayo eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.17.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda wo eky'ente oba eky'endiga ng'eriko akamogo oba ekikyamu kyonna, kubanga ebiri ng'ebyo Katonda wo abikyayira ddala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu yenna omusajja oba omukazi abeera mu mmwe, mu kimu ku bibuga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.17.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.17.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda wo by'akuwa, bw'anaakwatibwanga ng'akoze ebibi mu maaso ga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.17.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.17.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda wo, ng'amenye endagaano ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.17.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.17.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era ng'ajeemedde ekiragiro kyange n'asinza bakatonda abalala, ng'enjuba, oba omwezi, oba emmunyeenye ez'oku ggulu, bye siragiranga okubisinzanga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekikolwa ekyo ne kikutegeezebwangako; kale onookinoonyerezangako n'obwegendereza. Bwe kinaakakasibwanga nga kya mazima, ng'ekibi ekyo kikoleddwa mu Isirayiri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "onoofulumyanga omusajja oyo, oba omukazi oyo, akoze ekibi ekyo, wabweru wa wankaaki w'ekibuga n'omukuba amayinja, n'afa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu anattibwanga nga wamaze kulabikawo obujulizi bw'abantu babiri oba basatu, naye omuntu tattibwenga ku bujulizi bw'omuntu omu yekka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abajulizi be banaasookanga okukasuukirira omuntu oyo amayinja, n'abalala ne bagoberera. Kinaakusaaniranga okwemalangako ebibi ebinaabeeranga wakati mu mmwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Embuga Ezinaasalirwangamu Emisango",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe wanaabangawo emisango egireeteddwa mu mbuga yo nga mizibu gikukaluubiridde okusala, oba nga gya kuyiwa musaayi, oba gya kuwozaŋŋanya, oba kukubagana, oba ensonga endala zonna ezinaabangamu enkaayana mu bibuga byo, ensonga ezo zonna onoozitwalanga mu kifo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.17.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.17.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda wo ky'anaabanga yeerondedde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'onootuukanga eyo oneebuuzanga ku bakabona, be Baleevi, ne ku mulamuzi anaabanga akola omulimu ogwo mu kiseera ekyo. Banaakutegeezanga ensala yaabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onookoleranga ku nsala yaabwe eyo gye banaakuwanga mu kifo ekyo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.17.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.17.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ky'anaabanga yeerondedde. Weegenderezanga nnyo n'okola ebyo bye banaabanga bakulagidde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinaakugwaniranga okukola ng'amateeka ge banaabanga bakunnyonnyodde bwe gagamba, n'ensala yaabwe nga bw'eneebanga gye banaakutegeezanga. Bye banaakutegeezanga tobivangako kulaga ku mukono ogwa ddyo oba ku gwa kkono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu yenna anaanyoomanga omulamuzi oba kabona eyateekebwawo okuweereza",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.17.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.17.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda wo, omuntu oyo wa kufa. Bw'otyo bw'onoomalangamu ekibi mu Isirayiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bonna banaabiwuliranga ne batya, ne bataddayo nate kukola bya kyejo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eby'Obwakabaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'olimala okuyingira mu nsi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.17.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.17.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda wo gy'akuwa, n'ogirya, n'obeera omwo, oliyinza okugamba nti, \"Leka neeteekerewo kabaka ananfuganga okufaanana ng'amawanga amalala gonna aganneebunguludde;\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weegenderezanga n'ossaawo kabaka oyo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.17.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.17.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda wo gw'anaakulonderanga. Kikugwanira okumuggyanga mu bantu bo bennyini. Tokkirizibwenga kwessizangawo kabaka omunnaggwanga anaabanga tavudde mu baganda bo bennyini, okukufuganga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabaka oyo tateekwa kwefuniranga mbalaasi nnyingi, wadde okutumanga abantu mu Misiri bamufunirengayo embalaasi endala okwongeranga ku z'alina obungi; kubanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.17.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.17.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yagamba nti, \"Temuddangayo kukwata kkubo eryo,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tawasanga bakazi bangi kubanga bagenda kumukyamyanga. So tekimugwanira kwetuumangako zaabu n'effeeza ennyingi ennyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'anaamalanga okutebenkera ku ntebe ey'obwakabaka bwe, anaakoppololeranga amateeka gano mu kitabo ng'agaggyanga ku ga bakabona, Abaleevi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitabo ekyo anaabeeranga nakyo bulijjo, era anaakisomanga ennaku zonna ez'obulamu bwe, alyokenga ayige okutyanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.17.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.17.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda we, ng'agobereranga n'obwegendereza ebigambo byonna ebiri mu mateeka gano, ne mu biragiro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nga teyeekulumbaza kusukkirira ku bannansi banne, era nga takyama kuva ku mateeka gano okulaga ku mukono ogwa ddyo oba ku gwa kkono. Bw'anaakolanga bw'atyo, ye, n'ezzadde lye banaafuganga mu bwakabaka bwe, mu Isirayiri, okumala ennaku nnyingi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
